Description: Only pass -Wno-keyword-macro to clang
 The flag only exists in clang, so gcc prints "unrecognized command-line
 option '-Wno-keyword-macro'" on every diagnostic it emits, burying the real
 error messages in the build log.
Origin: Parrot
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-19
Index: hyprland-0.57.2+ds/CMakeLists.txt
===================================================================
--- hyprland-0.57.2+ds.orig/CMakeLists.txt
+++ hyprland-0.57.2+ds/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -109,7 +109,7 @@ add_compile_options(
   -Wall
   -Wextra
   -Wpedantic
-  -Wno-keyword-macro
+  $<$<CXX_COMPILER_ID:Clang>:-Wno-keyword-macro>
   -Wno-unused-result
   -Wno-unused-parameter
   -Wno-unused-value
